                    <tr>
                        <td class="bd-strong">Blazor WebAssembly (standalone)</td>
                        <td><code>BlazeDbOpfsStorage</code>, or <code>BlazeDbIndexedDbStorage</code> where OPFS cannot be written</td>
                        <td>WebAssembly has one thread: by construction</td>
                        <td><a href="/api/mcp/GetBlazeDbSetupGuide?hostingModel=standalone-wasm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">standalone-wasm</a></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="bd-strong">Blazor Web App, InteractiveWebAssembly</td>
                        <td>The same, from the <code>.Client</code> project</td>
                        <td>By construction - but never in a prerender</td>
                        <td><a href="/api/mcp/GetBlazeDbSetupGuide?hostingModel=wasm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">wasm</a></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="bd-strong">Blazor Web App, InteractiveAuto</td>
                        <td>The same, once the component runs in the browser</td>
                        <td>By construction, after the first, server-rendered visit</td>
                        <td><a href="/api/mcp/GetBlazeDbSetupGuide?hostingModel=auto" target="_blank" rel="noopener">auto</a></td>
